sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as App
    participant B as Authy
    participant U as Person
    participant S as Session
    App->>B: request a session
    B-->>App: scope and level needed
    B->>U: unlock · passphrase or WebAuthn
    U-->>B: unlocked
    B->>B: check P never leaves
    B->>S: sign grant · scope · expiry
    S-->>App: session open
    App->>S: read L · write S
    alt expired
      S-->>App: renew
      S->>B: verify standing
      B-->>S: extend
    else revoked
      B->>S: revoke
      S-->>App: closed
    end
    Note over B,S: one grant per app · no background key
